    "font" : "SFRM1000",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Let L∞(ΩR) be the space of essentially bounded measurable functions on ΩR, equipped with the norm: ∥f∥L∞(ΩR) = esssupx∈Ω"
